    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tests Read(), Store() and Status() operations for all variable placements and types with the FracBox model which contains <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_boundary" kindref="compound">Boundary</ref> objects. The operations are performed twice: 1) on the live model and 2) on a model recovered form disk.</para>
